 data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span> is an arbitrary set.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}\\)</span> have the signatures fixed in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" href=\"?note=154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" title=\"93-df-subalgebra\">93-df-subalgebra</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"10bfe2126b30365e\" href=\"?note=10bfe2126b30365e\" title=\"93-df-powers\">93-df-powers</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}subalgebra\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\land\n\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\land I\\in V\\to\n\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}\\bigl(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I;\\tau),\n\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B,I;\\tau)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}subalgebra\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\land\n\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\land I\\in V\\to\n\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}\\bigl(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I;\\tau),\n\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B,I;\\tau)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The predicate order follows <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" href=\"?note=154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" title=\"93-df-subalgebra\">93-df-suba